Gauge implementation
Use SVG with a circular path and stroke-dasharray.

Example:
<svg viewBox="0 0 160 100">
  <path
    d="M 15 85 A 65 65 0 0 1 145 85"
    fill="none"
    stroke="#24463A"
    stroke-width="13"
    stroke-linecap="round"
  />

  <path
    d="M 15 85 A 65 65 0 0 1 145 85"
    fill="none"
    stroke="#16D979"
    stroke-width="13"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-dasharray="..."
  />
</svg>


